{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01612","headline":"杂曲歌辞 出自蓟北门行 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 出自蓟北门行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虏阵横北荒，胡星曜精芒。\n羽书速惊电，烽火昼连光。\n虎竹救边急，戎车森已行。\n明主不安席，按劒心飞扬。\n推毂出猛将，连旗登战场。\n兵威冲绝漠，杀气凌穹苍。\n列卒赤山下，开营紫塞傍。\n途冬沙风紧，旌旗飒凋伤。\n[画]角悲海月，征衣卷天霜。\n挥刃斩楼兰，弯弓射贤王。\n单于一平荡，种落自奔亡。\n收功报天子，行歌归咸阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}